{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284170","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284170","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1028417001:1":{"text":"又是你们……还有什么事吗？先说好，我真的没力气，别让我再去找人了。","source_cn":"又是你们……还有什么事吗？先说好，我真的没力气，别让我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9DB68EA1CA01CBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028417002:1":{"text":"请试试这些草药，应该可以让你恢复一些气力。","source_cn":"请试试这些草药，应该可以让你恢复一些气力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BA76C841B7CBBC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028417003:1":{"text":"你们能治疗我们身上的病？弥萨忒保佑，希望有效果。","source_cn":"你们能治疗我们身上的病？弥萨忒保佑，希望有效果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA424F46A4BBAD74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028417004:1":{"text":"味道有点怪怪的……","source_cn":"味道有点怪怪的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16D18A1AEE9FC4ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028417005:1":{"text":"……感觉身上轻松了，也能拿动斧子了……","source_cn":"……感觉身上轻松了，也能拿动斧子了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF382ED2064E7358A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"sa